WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.208 --> 00:00:05.202
A first run of LUCID starts with one question. What's your role?

2
00:00:05.553 --> 00:00:14.469
Developer, Security engineer, Manager, or Executive. Each one lands on a different first screen, tuned to what that person actually needs.

3
00:00:15.293 --> 00:00:23.792
Pick Security engineer. Add a work email, so AI-authored code is attributed to you, and say whether you handle government CUI.

4
00:00:26.174 --> 00:00:32.583
Then a short guided tour, tailored to the role. A security engineer starts at the quarantine queue.

5
00:00:32.933 --> 00:00:38.088
The role shapes the walkthrough and the landing screen. It never weakens the security gate.
